  "correctness_argument": "Some essentiality releases call a gene into a category that is not a boolean, and under the owner's rule of 2026-10-12 (the data is the data: every reported call is stored, never collapsed) those calls need a home. Royet 2025 Table S4 classifies every one of the 5,729 KT2440 genes on LB agar and after outgrowth in LB into TRANSIT HMM states; measured on the deposited workbook (sha256 b786a2a1...): LB agar ES 600, NE 4,458, GA 435, GD 223, N/A 13; outgrowth ES 722, NE 4,238, GA 533, GD 223, N/A 13, the N/A rows being the 13 genes with no TA site. The paper's Table 1 footnote c defines the four states (E essential, GA growth-advantage, GD growth-defect, NE non-essential). Goodall 2018 releases 317 'unclear' TraDIS calls (a likelihood ratio between the two modes), which the boolean leaf of #924 refuses and its store ledgered. A grade or an 'unclear' is a different released quantity from is_essential, so by the policy's Rule 6 it is a sibling leaf, GradedGeneEssentialityPhenotype, under the same parent Phenotype, not a widened boolean: its label essentiality_call holds the release's own category, checked against the categories its evidence type releases (GRADED_ESSENTIALITY_CALLS) and against the evidence's typed call. It carries GeneEssentialityEvidence, the #924 descriptor, whose class keeps every existing field and validator branch; Royet's rule is one new EssentialityEvidenceType member, tnseq_hmm_state, under insertion_depletion, and its per-gene statistics (TA sites, the sites the HMM labeled each state, mean insertion rate, mean read count, the state) are eight new optional-by-construction fields, refused on any other type, with consistency checks (the labeled sites sum to the TA sites, N/A exactly at zero TA sites). The boolean leaf now refuses tnseq_hmm_state evidence, since a graded call has no boolean. A bacterial experiment pair, BacterialGradedGeneEssentialityExperiment and its reference, joins the experiment unions and maps. No served record changes meaning: every existing essentiality record validates unchanged, the new fields dump as null on them. Two new stores: graded_gene_essentiality_goodall2018 (the 317 unclear calls) and graded_gene_essentiality_royet2025 (11,458 graded calls).",
  "measurement_type_decision": true,
  "source_quotes": [
