        "page": null,
        "retrieved": null
      },
      "quote": "The gene essentiality of the Tn-seq input libraries was next determined using the TRANSIT software (DeJesus et al. 2015), which employs a Hidden Markov Model (HMM) method to predict essentiality and non-essentiality for individual insertion sites (DeJesus and Ioerger 2013).",
      "note": "the rule behind every Table S4 call; Table S4 releases each gene's TA sites labeled ES, GD, NE and GA and its state classification"
    },
    {
