        "method": "MinerU OCR of the publisher PDF (torchcell-library mirror)",
        "page": null,
        "retrieved": null
      },
      "quote": "The HMM analysis identified 600 genes essential for growth on LB agar, representing $1 0 . 8 \\%$ of the genes of P. putida KT2440. 4458 genes were identified as non-essential genes (NE) (Table S4).",
      "note": "the LB agar sheet's counts, re-derived at build time. The states are defined in Table 1 footnote c of paper.pdf (sha256 d6d54b16607a7617034f4db71814f01eac04885a7fc67ed702d6a36064498f09, page 8): \"c State of each gene in LB defined by the TRANSIT software using a Hidden Markov Model: E, essential; GA, growth-\u00adAdvantage; GD, growth-\u00addefect; NE, non-\u00adessential.\". The OCR dropped that footnote; Table S4 writes the essential state ES, and N/A for a gene with no TA site"
    },
